# events for: -graph-run anim.vhg -script anim.script
# the first step starts at the input (45 deg), then the blind follows it with the smoothing of TGauge (0.5 s);
# inputs outside min..max are clamped; smoothing shorter than two steps jumps, like TGauge
0.0  force x.q 0.5
0.5  force x.q 1
2.0  force x.q 3
2.5  force x.q -1
3.0  force on.q 1
4.0  force on.q 0
